{"id":"btnc5pc8gjqopwjqb0ee69nhg","title":"DNA揭示达芬奇密码：圣血之布的千年秘密","originalTitle":"DNA on the Shroud of Turin reveals centuries of hidden secrets","summary":"科学家利用先进DNA测序技术分析了1978年从圣血之布上采集的样本，首次采用严谨的PCR-free下一代宏基因组测序技术，揭示了布上隐藏的复杂生物历史，包括人类、细菌、真菌、植物和动物的DNA，以及地中海红珊瑚。这些发现为研究该布料的环境和接触人群提供了新线索，但无法确定其年代或真伪。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261108202703.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T02:48:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:30.389Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:30.389Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b93bef64-7bf7-454a-8019-ee0d2d84ad18","title":"DNA测序技术解析圣血之布成分，年代与真伪待定"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b93bef64-7bf7-454a-8019-ee0d2d84ad18","title":"DNA测序技术解析圣血之布成分，年代与真伪待定"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fy3SmQsL4cts","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}